{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32222","headline":"哭王元裕 · 温庭筠","name":"哭王元裕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说萧郎逐逝川，伯牙因此绝清弦。\n柳边犹忆青骢影，坟上俄生碧草烟。\n箧里诗书疑谢後，梦中风貌似潘前。\n他时若到相寻处，碧树红楼自宛然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}